### Investment Recommendations

**Best Bet: 2-Bedroom in Unincorporated Areas (Las Vegas Strip)**
* Home Price: ~$361K
* Expected Revenue: $50K - $87K/year
* ROI: 7.9% - 18.0%
* Why: Best ROI, most liquid market, strong data (1,626 listings)

**Must-Have Amenities:**
1. Pool (+93% revenue)
2. Hot tub (+68% revenue)
3. Pool table (+66% revenue)

